  "translation": "Gomme bonwe, banna ka moka ba Yisraele ba tla go kgoši, gomme ba re go kgoši: Ke ka baka eng bana ba rena, banna ba Yehuda, ba go utswile, gomme ba fetišitše ⟨את⟩ kgoši le ⟨את⟩ ntlo ya gagwe go feta ⟨את⟩ Yoredene, le banna ka moka ba Dafida le gagwe?",
